      hMood: L.mood, aMood: R.mood, hEmo: L.emo, aEmo: R.emo, hTeam: L.team, aTeam: R.team, hState: L.state, aState: R.state, hCrown: L.crown, aCrown: R.crown, hPlace: L.place, aPlace: R.place,
